            {
              "type": "Progress Notes",
              "title": "Annual Physical",
              "author": "PCP",
              "date": "2021-09-22T12:05",
              "body": "24 y/o, annual.\n\nInterval: warts cleared in April, none since. Gardasil series finished in June. COVID vaccinated x2 in the spring.\n\nMeds: none. Allergies: NKDA.\nSocial: never smoker. Social drinking, weekends, 1-2. Sexually active with men, condoms more often than before but not always. No contraception, declines.\nFH unchanged (mother hypothyroid, father HTN).\n\nPHQ-2 0.\n\nExam: well-appearing. BP and vitals fine. Thyroid normal. Heart RRR. Lungs clear. Abdomen soft. Skin clear. Pelvic (chaperoned): normal external genitalia, no lesions, cervix normal. Pap and GC/CT collected.\n\nA/P:\n- Pap today, due.\n- CBC, CMP, TSH.\n- GC/CT.\n- Flu shot.\n- COVID booster when she becomes eligible."
            }
          ]
